      <activity id="f9287921-e258-5c4c-b88c-1e132146e0d5" activityNameId="d7d21960-7a4b-512d-9046-607f18ad82bf" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, transoceanic freight ship, Fahrzeug</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, transoceanic freight ship, Fahrzeug
Inventory refers to the entire transport life cycle. Port infrastructure expenditures and environmental interventions are allocated based the yearly throughput (444.7 Mio t). Vessel manufacturing is allocated based on the total kilometric performance (2126552 km) and its transport performance (75148dwt /unit). For each transport activity 2 ports are required.;
UUID: de4cd917-9057-3073-86a4-2cf3c309018d
The module calls the modules addressing: production of vessel; construction and land use of port; operation, maintenance and disposal of port and vessel. In this module included is the energy consumption as well as the emissios.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Sampling Procedure 
Extrapolations: Extrapolations
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_de4cd917-9057-3073-86a4-2cf3c309018d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
